DataSet Tracker - License and Usage Notice
=============================================

Copyright (c) Alexandre Matov. All rights reserved except as granted below.

1. Scope
--------
This repository contains C# source code and a compiled Windows application
("DataSet Tracker" / EBTracker.exe) developed by Alexandre Matov for
real-time image analysis on personal computers, smartphones, and smart
glasses hardware. The source code depends on third-party Unity plugins
that are NOT included in this repository -- see DEPENDENCIES.md.

